sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Console as Target AWS Console
    participant GH as GitHub dev environment
    participant Job as Manual Deploy dev job
    participant STS as AWS STS
    participant CF as CloudFormation
    Operator->>Console: Create key-access stack in 786638967830 / us-east-2
    Console-->>Operator: Dedicated IAM user and execution-role ARN
    Operator->>Console: Create IAM user access key manually
    Operator->>GH: Store key pair as environment secrets
    Operator->>Job: workflow_dispatch from dev branch
    GH-->>Job: Supply environment secrets and variables
    Job->>STS: GetCallerIdentity using configured key
    STS-->>Job: Account identity
    alt Expected account, region and execution role
        Job->>CF: SAM deploy with separate execution role
    else Wrong target
        Job-->>Operator: Fail before deployment
    end
    Note over Console,CF: All operations remain subject to SCPs; deployment is not yet verified
